SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_mdr_side_rear_setback_height_tiered", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "SETBACK.SIDE", "title": "6.2.2.3 Table 6.2.2-1 RO1; Table 6.2.2-2 AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SIDE", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "part up to 4.5m -> 1.5; part 4.5-7.5m -> 2.0; part >7.5m -> +0.5m per 3m or part over 7.5m", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "formula"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_mdr_side_rear_setback_height_tiered", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"side_and_rear_setback_min\", \"operator\": \"formula\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": \"part up to 4.5m -> 1.5; part 4.5-7.5m -> 2.0; part >7.5m -> +0.5m per 3m or part over 7.5m\"}\nStructure scope 'all buildings' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Part-based wording ('for that part'). Table 1.5-1 (s1.5 Building work regulated under the City Plan) lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' -> 'Buildings: Relevant zone code ...' (Section 33(2) BA). Applies to buildings (incl. Class 1 and Class 10a buildings). For 'Structures' only the Coastal erosion hazard and Road widening overlay codes are alternatives; 'QDC setbacks will apply to any building or structure where an alternative setback is not provided in the above codes.' Scheme refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, not the QHC."}$q$::jsonb);
