retation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"waterway_building_setback_line\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"setback distance is property-specific (nominated line; contact Council)\", \"eaves 1m, cantilevered balcony 2m, attached open pergola 2.5m intrusion\", \"pool <= 1m above natural ground: unlimited intrusion subject to structural independence and maintenance access\", \"cantilevered (deck) <= 1.2m above natural ground: unlimited\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'buildings and structures incl. pools, pergolas, decks' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.5-1 lists this overlay code as a QDC boundary clearance alternative for both Buildings and Structures. Setback line is per-property (not numeric in scheme)."}$q$::jsonb);
